{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "cce2f0609eb8212d06a9bf6a7fcc12b6a7208f25e27a5c359d59f284c0ced5d0", "ja": "必勝！　恋の千本ノック", "zh": "必胜！爱情的千次击球练习", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b9872f9a4146b2fc07746bcfba419078d2a88a3d38401d7f10f6f1783a994c1a", "ja": "レッスン後。3人は恋についての研究結果を\n発表していくが、あまりしっくりこない。\n偶然通りがかった紗代子にプロデューサーが\nアドバイスを求めると、恋の特訓が始まる。\n3人はそこで、恋の真髄（？）をみつける。", "zh": "训练结束后，三人发表了研究爱情的成果，\n但没有一个答案让全部人都信服。\n制作人向碰巧经过的纱代子寻求建议，\n开始了关于爱情的特训。\n而三人也从中发现爱情的真谛（？）。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "21ea720fc71af6fbacc964b0dc428a8517cab8d7be707200befab77a7b5aeef1", "ja": "（ウィルゴのレッスンは順調。この調子なら、\nステージは特に問題なさそうだ。後は……）", "zh": "（『处女座』的训练非常顺利，看样子\n表演应该不会有什么大问题，接着就剩……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "04e875a4f71f26bfaea7ab41bb7ada9c14a4e2677c11035d5900bed206341a0d", "ja": "それじゃ……コホン。みんな、恋について\n調べてきましたね？　さっそく、話し合いましょう！", "zh": "那么……咳咳。各位，你们都查过\n什么是爱情了吧？马上来分享一下成果吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1002_015siz", "source_sha256": "ec9da3126de0faaeac298baa8a42bd2c979be6b7925ce9b7cc8d803b262e403d", "ja": "私は学校の友達に、恋について聞いてきたの。\nその子は、野球部の先輩に片思いしてるらしくて……。", "zh": "我去问了学校的朋友有关爱情的事。\n因为她好像暗恋某个棒球社的学长……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "d538ed806e0a5d73b464b742927039f5b4e50d8f075d0f3bedba7dad74a1906a", "ja": "野球部！？　すっげー面白そう！\nそれでそれで？　どうなったんだ？", "zh": "棒球社！？感觉超有意思的！\n然后呢然后呢？她怎么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "ed3078fcaa828a644c340468906d2cbc752a359209c919c51008708e0315411d", "ja": "彼女はいつも、グラウンドで球拾いをしている\nその先輩のことを、フェンス越しに眺めてるって。", "zh": "她说自己总是隔着围篱，\n默默看着学长在操场捡球的样子。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "35d5edaf915cd6b86d57d34512162171150056c8ec8baddf52da2b816e01183f", "ja": "うんうん！　球拾い、超大事だからな！\n……でも、それのどこが恋なんだ？", "zh": "嗯嗯嗯！捡球确实超级重要的！\n……不过，这哪里跟爱情有关了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "c1eaffa83d6f8258eb71b387c4fd3d0601c2363bddd6bfe34a5d383265112f4e", "ja": "さあ……よくわからないけど。汗だくになりながら\n一生懸命な姿に、ときめいたって話で……。", "zh": "天知道……我也一头雾水，她是说学长\n满身大汗、拚命努力的样子让她怦然心动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "b03803eb2183760dff4fcb420445334d5a0546f111a2e962f46f693d27946960", "ja": "ん～。運動して汗いっぱいかくのは気持ちいいけど、\n見てるだけでも、そうなるのかな～……？", "zh": "嗯～运动流汗是会觉得很畅快没错，\n但只是在旁边看也会有这种感觉吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "89e20749d4ad3905c8aed1c4e3b0b2c79f5b51395e070b0478488b4be19e2e53", "ja": "でも、きっとそのお友達にとっては、\nその先輩の汗が、特別に見えるんだと思います！", "zh": "不过，我想在你朋友的眼中，\n那个学长流的汗肯定是与众不同的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "164ca796108e0d433c636035a3b5d753eadfb4fa21e2cec3adf6d705a0a3af31", "ja": "特別な汗か～。うーん、今イチわかんないなー。\nそういう百合子は、何を調べてきたんだ？", "zh": "与众不同的汗水啊～嗯……有听没有懂～\n那么百合子，你查到什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "aa41651d7c7c869cf83bc00427bd084dda498c1354e981c72748ed8c30fcef8b", "ja": "えっと。私はやっぱり、\n本が参考になるかなと思って……。", "zh": "这个嘛，\n我还是觉得书本可能比较有参考价值……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "ea4fdf25a1077ab6a0834df80017810f0bb0f0dc2492a7886a69adf447ecc0e9", "ja": "最近、海外のスパイ小説を読んでいるんですけど。\n主人公のスパイが、とってもダンディなんです！", "zh": "我最近在看国外的谍报小说，\n间谍主角是个彬彬有礼的绅士！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "d596fe2e0619343095a01e919763ba40aedcaa2049146980c5fffe35ca1b6b30", "ja": "うんうん、スパイってかっこいいよな！\nオレもそう思う！", "zh": "嗯嗯嗯，间谍很帅气呢！\n我也这么觉得！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "6ad561587c1ac593f39d8e9831d118f3489ff4b0100d5885e1785eb8b02b194a", "ja": "ダンディ……ですか。\n渋い……大人っぽい魅力、ってことかな。", "zh": "绅士……这样啊。\n应该是有股内敛……成熟的魅力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1014_026yur", "source_sha256": "5f9b15ac29a044ed48decac06070caa20a81aca4baaf02a0bbd6fb3c6ae0deab", "ja": "敵に追われたスパイは、やっとの思いで国境に\n辿り着くんです。そこを、銃で撃たれて……ううっ！", "zh": "被敌人追捕的间谍，费尽千辛万苦终于\n抵达了国境，却在那里中弹身亡……呜呜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "d9cbb28b359ef8bf3092a6e93e39590266b6edb1e52bc40eb2f38ba8bf9ce995", "ja": "あんなにがんばったのに報われないなんて、私、\nもう涙が止まらなくて……これって、恋ですか！？", "zh": "那么努力却没有得到回报，\n害我眼泪停不下来……这样算是爱情吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1016_p", "source_sha256": "c1c7e9b59e99966189c3b4ca25adcf770fc10982afab31559b9583fe15c6237f", "ja": "いや……う～ん。\nそれは、恋じゃないんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "呃……嗯～\n我想应该不算吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "3fba31d28996d440dee1e903f7f03659994b8995f39ffb342a94160678604915", "ja": "え？\n……じゃあ、私のこの気持ちはなんなんですか？", "zh": "咦？\n……那我心中这种感受又是怎么回事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "955a01811f8a7decf47cd4dc0af352c5492de35abc3b7ac563ec82fad03bb4c9", "ja": "たぶん……読書の感想だと思う。", "zh": "我想……就是所谓的阅读心得吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "e16525c1a8bb48fe7ee48f15c5a131539c7f606fa0eaff5387dd1e3775d2a76d", "ja": "ガーン！　うう……やっぱり本の中と、\n現実の恋とは違うんですね。難しいなぁ……。", "zh": "什么！呜呜……书中的世界\n果然跟现实的爱情不一样，好难懂啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0425a62d682315e6cbf27896ef4561fea03107b8172db7ea3970466a2bcbe2ef", "ja": "昴はどうなんだ？　何か調べて来たのか？", "zh": "昴你呢？你查到什么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "3dee0f3c670a02d08e539825b9fcd2abe1d8789e980cd73fad1aa2d37f66795b", "ja": "お、オレは……実をいうと、どうやって\n調べていいかも全然わかんなくて……。", "zh": "我、我嘛……老实说，\n我连要怎么查都不知道……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "f18b039ae9d2f354531df152065e894157c3549237247c560d8a980326067c6a", "ja": "だから一生懸命、恋がなんだか考えようと\nしたんだけど……。うーん……。", "zh": "所以拚了命在思考爱情到底是什么，\n可是……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1023_p", "source_sha256": "bcbae2b3bdc90062711390af9afd2e3666da9395ff8555e4bd8529d056207732", "ja": "そうだな……。たとえば、昴のお父さんとお母さんの\nなれ初めとかを聞いてみたりするのは、どうだ？", "zh": "这个嘛……比方说，问问昴的父母\n当初是怎么开始谈恋爱的，这样如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1024_047sub", "source_sha256": "eb9f881d3215ce22aa268f8bae43f6830ce095b55a14d84404116eecb5024689", "ja": "な、なに言ってんだよ、{$P$}！\nそんなの、ハズすぎて無理だって……！！", "zh": "你、你在说什么啊，{$P$}！\n这么难为情的事我哪开得了口……！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1025_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "2efca8f962805992af5b9fe52cd5a83cb328d279d106474c6d65f783acd7ca0e", "ja": "{$P$}、ちょっといいですか？\nみんなは、休憩中？　お疲れさま♪", "zh": "{$P$}，可以打扰一下吗？\n大家正在休息吗？辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1027_047sub", "source_sha256": "e426ca146a51012c74e9081f1d50b64b404bb0dc3b28e7b2ff0f6e3cc47ef57d", "ja": "紗代子～！　助けてくれよ～！\nこれ、千本ノックより辛いよ～！", "zh": "纱代子～！求你帮帮我们～！\n这比千次击球练习还要难熬啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "ad3dcff0fbbcdf3018f5a3830c756899b350fccd88254108a2491b349a5c216d", "ja": "どうしたの？　昴ちゃん。\n千本ノックって……特訓か何か？", "zh": "小昴怎么啦？\n千次击球练习……是指什么特训吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c56015a007ab3d292937c3fc1d9c7fdab6305eb60c61730c5ffcd9b219c0880c", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子。\nいや、千本ノックはしてないけど、実は……。", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。\n我们不是在进行千次击球练习啦，事情是这样的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "8cd78277f4cda89d07305425fd53292306157bd30d4e2027611cac9ab7f71eca", "ja": "なるほど、恋……わかりました！\nみんな、私にまかせて！", "zh": "原来如此，爱情……我明白了！\n各位，包在我身上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1032_015siz", "source_sha256": "94d4a72227de855ba2f2b476e4a2bdb42fd02fafdc179179d45a5e7ee7de1270", "ja": "えっ！　紗代子さん、まさか……\n恋をしたことが、あるんですか！？", "zh": "咦！纱代子，难道你……\n谈过恋爱吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "1b14ec22473a79f8f87fb020bc3b245b4ef6b0a38252d35464f2618099e41b43", "ja": "ううん！　ないよ！", "zh": "没有！我没有谈过！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1034_026yur", "source_sha256": "8c0a52e9db2b269ee3f5faa8228ea57fa653525939260f12d668e998d4efd2c7", "ja": "えっ！？\nあの、じゃあ、どうして……？", "zh": "咦！？\n那你为什么这么有自信……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1035_027say", "source_sha256": "b9f9251d12a7fd49c3f22cd11f38ad44430a1d7df727bd7be2d0be662a537103", "ja": "私も、恋はよくわからないけど……気合いを入れて\n想像すれば、感じ取れるんじゃないかなって。", "zh": "我虽然也不是很懂爱情……但我觉得，\n只要用心去想像，应该也能明白些什么才对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1036_027say", "source_sha256": "d57ec9054a0478b1bfa25172b373a271a1ba662e540aa16715e702be37eddf71", "ja": "だからまずは、「好き」の気持ちを言葉にこめて……\n恋の千本ノックなんて、どうかな！", "zh": "所以要先把「喜欢」的心意注入话语中……\n要不要来进行爱情的千次击球练习呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1037_047sub", "source_sha256": "931ecf5d238d85b20e79c5c7a46cfcf4b0b64ccc7e8d757e5fc826ea59e278ae", "ja": "おお～……いいじゃん！　それ、やってみようよ！\nやっぱ特訓といえば、千本ノックだよな！", "zh": "喔喔……不错耶！我们来试试看吧！\n说到特训，当然少不了千次击球练习啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1038_027say", "source_sha256": "42541a701d911ab99aad741b3b64c75f03f32f62661449f2e65b667ab3a9b656", "ja": "「好き」って千回言うんだからね？\nさあみんな、好きっていう言葉に、気持ちをこめて！", "zh": "要讲一千次「喜欢」喔！\n来吧大家，把自己的心意放进「喜欢」这个词中！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1039_p", "source_sha256": "94546e3f57681c7203402927d2d38d394ec51ff879119bea0359024828c0a06d", "ja": "なるほど、声にしてみるっていうのは、\nアリかもしれないな。よし、やってみよう！", "zh": "原来如此，喊出声音或许是个不错的办法呢。\n好，大家试试吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1040_015siz", "source_sha256": "be0f341a03198b35021ba688bd2b24741797527d8ef9678a2c4c6706a275cbc4", "ja": "好き！　好き！　好き！　好き！", "zh": "喜欢！喜欢！喜欢！喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1041_026yur", "source_sha256": "be0f341a03198b35021ba688bd2b24741797527d8ef9678a2c4c6706a275cbc4", "ja": "好き！　好き！　好き！　好き！", "zh": "喜欢！喜欢！喜欢！喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "be0f341a03198b35021ba688bd2b24741797527d8ef9678a2c4c6706a275cbc4", "ja": "好き！　好き！　好き！　好き！", "zh": "喜欢！喜欢！喜欢！喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "4cc50ebad5e056102e52ec541d23e553e959766dfbc490107238997cf4620ac6", "ja": "好き！　ふぅ～……みんな、千回言えたね！\nどう？　恋心、ちょっとわかってきたんじゃないかな！", "zh": "喜欢！呼～大家都说完一千次了呢！\n怎么样？是不是稍微明白爱慕的心情了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1044_015siz", "source_sha256": "f5af12e0ff6cf22aa4ef6cc27b18704340358190fdd514cbde88a8bf6f1bd64a", "ja": "う、う～ん……。\n百合子、どうだった？", "zh": "呃、嗯……\n百合子，你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1045_026yur", "source_sha256": "e9026dd2b6b0d506c7ba5bc0f6e093a0ca8e071fd98eb3ee2026acafc51d2b2c", "ja": "私は、ちょっとよくわからなかったかも……。\n運動が苦手なせいかなぁ……。", "zh": "我好像还不是很明白……\n是因为我不擅长运动的关系吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1046_047sub", "source_sha256": "a3d4b83104056f1196deadac3f1baabe01254789fc5169b83bd9e99f8c0c1029", "ja": "でも、オレもよくわかんなかったぜ？\n運動が得意とか関係ないかも。", "zh": "不过，我也还是不明白啊，\n我想这应该跟擅不擅长运动无关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1047_027say", "source_sha256": "75c21715d35c85c4886bca9020f2400ca6f907c382dc1a7ff7ed705920568fd6", "ja": "大丈夫、これはまだ序の口！　スキスキマラソンに\nラブベンチプレス、恋愛大回転もやってみよう！", "zh": "别担心，刚才只是小试身手而已！接着再来试试\n喜欢马拉松、爱的卧举和恋爱转圈圈吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1048_015siz", "source_sha256": "fd3971e2d8522e35575fb40d0a5ed1dd7568c64dec52d9f17114937bb480656a", "ja": "え！？　まだやるんですか！？", "zh": "咦！？还没完吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1049_027say", "source_sha256": "04dc66358159713fcb723d5f8bd07058b7d6fbf71bf030b51fcf9411d04c9c0f", "ja": "じゃあ、まずは恋愛大回転のお手本を見せるね。\nらぶらぶらぶらぶ……キャッ！？", "zh": "那么，我先来示范恋爱转圈圈给大家看。\nLove～Love～Love～Love……呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1050_p", "source_sha256": "e841a78ebbb46db69cacf0345f740b29334e9d489aad81869950199075457376", "ja": "おっと！　……大丈夫か、紗代子！", "zh": "小心！\n……你没事吧，纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1051_027say", "source_sha256": "034a9c64b15e29b1772d087197a1455fc6db1c4bdd46eb47462bd5eb166f2eff", "ja": "す、すみません、{$P$}！\nちょっと、足がふらついちゃって……。", "zh": "不、不好意思，{$P$}！\n一不小心就重心不稳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1052_p", "source_sha256": "f176bbe0cd45bc2f25a192ea8e62668b1980d52a55a2abd2be690ba256bc6212", "ja": "千本ノックしたばかりだからな、無理はよくないぞ。\n紗代子が頑張り屋なのはわかるけど……。", "zh": "毕竟才刚做完千次击球练习，别太勉强自己了。\n我知道纱代子你很努力，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1053_027say", "source_sha256": "e6a25a4bc40c46765b6eb70dee314f6dc012bf0e36cde73533219574b9dcd2d5", "ja": "あ、ありがとうございます、{$P$}。\n……あ、あの。なんだか私、その……。", "zh": "谢、谢谢你，{$P$}。\n……那、那个，我好像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1054_027say", "source_sha256": "9cb98fc63418385026400b08d96b55481c34e565586cff34ab18d495840c38ad", "ja": "ど、どうしてだろう……{$P$}に\n助けられて、なんだかドキドキしてきたような……。", "zh": "不、不晓得为什么……被{$P$}\n扶了一把后，心里就小鹿乱撞的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1055_026yur", "source_sha256": "9be3c7705cf68ba88f764e94b70093162b028ba88b5cd7be8a20e498a0d66d13", "ja": "あっ！？　静香ちゃん、こ、これだよ！\nこれがきっと……！", "zh": "啊！？静香，就、就是这个！\n这肯定就是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1056_015siz", "source_sha256": "04a6b7f069c68f14da4c65757fbca10ece041965903fc5779eaa10afe63f495f", "ja": "う、うん！\nこれが、そうなのね……！", "zh": "对、对啊！\n就是这个没错……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1057_047sub", "source_sha256": "61a6480a58d4a3322bc789c0cf969d22559b04beb9286330b7b833fdbc0baa69", "ja": "これってなんだ？\nでもなんか、ドキドキする……？", "zh": "这个是指什么？\n不过我也觉得心跳得好快耶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1058_027say", "source_sha256": "ec074aa33f86b8abc04dd068de962745b854b2912cc1e1b5fc95141f4220ab59", "ja": "わっ……私、行かなくちゃ！\n{$P$}、失礼します！", "zh": "我……我得走了！\n{$P$}，我先告辞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1059_p", "source_sha256": "3a33b11c3dbf005b8269e623c388896c1e4334c9603248315189b5bba081fc75", "ja": "あっ、紗代子！？\nおーい、どこに行くんだ、紗代子……！", "zh": "啊，纱代子！？\n喂──！你要去哪啊，纱代子……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1060_026yur", "source_sha256": "9ed959c2e00223caf9041dc115e542cbb5b2dc29c2e28d4277c99aa2fe692d2c", "ja": "もう、{$P$}さん、ダメですよ！\n今の紗代子さんの表情、見てなかったんですか？", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}先生你这样不行啦！\n你没看到纱代子刚才的表情吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1061_015siz", "source_sha256": "b2e30e3008412b9304ba0af47728ac8acb8e18183b9bab9e87bf29061287c0db", "ja": "あれがきっと、恋なんですね……！\n私たち、恋の真髄を見つけたかもしれません！", "zh": "那个，肯定就是爱情了……！\n我们搞不好发现爱情的真谛了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1062_p", "source_sha256": "816bea7b270bcbc03655379aa524a1a37ecdbe935ded518abc744fcac1af0f1a", "ja": "恋の真髄……？", "zh": "爱情的真谛……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0085_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0085_story_02_1063_p", "source_sha256": "95dcfb6cef5ee2715321a2cd68b3522376860ad7663dc83701a3c27f52aaa02a", "ja": "（なんだかよくわからないけど……\nもう少し、みんなのことを見守ってみる事にしよう）", "zh": "（虽然不清楚到底是怎么回事……\n但我还是先继续在旁守候吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
